858. Sedem antiochenam occupat, deinde Constantinopolitanam,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  1027. Quam Fidei formulam ediderit in
 <COL N="1248"></COL> concilio Antiocheno, et an illam ejuraverit, 1027, 1028.</ITEM> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Eusebius</HI>  episcopus Vercellencis invitatur a legatis sedis
