affirmans respondet,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></ITEM> <CAPTION COM="1248">G</CAPTION> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Georgius Cappadox</HI>  intrusus a Constantio in ecclesiam
Alexandrinam, expulso Athanasio, 829, 910, 1010, 1012.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Monstruosus</HI>  appellatur a Nazianzeno, 829. Similis Ario,
